insert into seo_update values
  (1, '14-antilles-3d-printed-vase-ivory', '14-antilles-3d-printed-vase-ivory', 'Antilles 14" 3D Printed Vase, Ivory', 'The Antilles vase brings sculptural, modern texture to any surface. Its 3D printed body is finished in soft ivory, with a stacked, finely ribbed silhouette that catches light from every angle. At 14 inches tall it works beautifully alone on a console, bookshelf or dining table, or holding a few dried stems. A natural fit for contemporary, coastal and minimalist interiors.', 'Ivory 14-inch Antilles 3D printed vase with a tiered, finely ribbed silhouette'),
  (2, '38-opulence-meta', '38-opulence-meta', 'Opulence 38" Tall Floor Vase', 'Make an entrance with the Opulence floor vase. Standing 38 inches tall, its slim cylindrical form is finished in warm cream with a speckled metallic pattern that fades into a deep taupe base. Place it in an entryway, beside a sofa or in an empty corner to add height and quiet luxury, with or without tall branches or pampas grass.', 'Tall 38-inch Opulence floor vase in cream with speckled metallic pattern and taupe base'),
  (3, 'barronford-brown-glass-vase-12', 'barronford-brown-glass-vase-12', 'Barronford 12" Glass Vase on Wood Base', 'The Barronford vase combines two natural materials in one striking piece: a freeform glass vessel resting in a sculptural wood root base. Each base has its own grain and shape, so no two look exactly alike. At 12 inches it is ideal for a single stem, greenery or water plants, and adds an organic, earthy note to coffee tables, shelves and desks.', 'Barronford 12-inch freeform glass vase set in a natural wood root base'),
  (4, 'navy-blue-ginger-jar', 'navy-blue-ginger-jar', 'Navy Blue Ginger Jar with Lid', 'A timeless classic in deep, glossy navy. This lidded ginger jar is topped with a gold finial and has the traditional rounded shoulder that makes ginger jars a designer favourite. Style it on a mantel, sideboard or bookshelf, alone or in pairs, for an elegant touch that suits traditional, transitional and modern interiors alike.', 'Glossy navy blue ginger jar with lid and gold finial'),
  (5, 'draytonoak-gold-vase-14', 'draytonoak-gold-vase-14', 'Draytonoak 14" Gold Ruffled Vase', 'The Draytonoak vase looks like folded fabric caught in motion. Its ruffled, freeform shape is finished in burnished gold outside with a cool blue-grey interior that adds depth and contrast. At 14 inches it is a conversation piece on a coffee table or console, and pairs well with its larger 20" sibling for a layered display.', 'Draytonoak 14-inch gold ruffled sculptural vase with blue-grey interior'),
  (6, 'draytonoak-gold-vase-20', 'draytonoak-gold-vase-20', 'Draytonoak 20" Large Gold Ruffled Vase', 'The larger Draytonoak makes a dramatic centrepiece. Its wide, ruffled rim flows like draped fabric, finished in burnished gold with a contrasting blue-grey interior. At 20 inches it holds its own on a dining table, entry console or kitchen island, empty as a sculpture or filled with bold tropical leaves.', 'Large Draytonoak 20-inch gold vase with wide ruffled rim and blue-grey interior'),
  (7, 'bai-stone-gold-metal-vase', 'bai-stone-gold-metal-vase', 'Bai Stone Gold Vase', 'Modern glam meets sculpture in the Bai Stone vase. A softly flared, champagne-gold body rises from a cluster of rounded orbs at its base, creating a silhouette that feels both playful and refined. Use it as a standalone accent on a sideboard or shelf, or add a single stem for a minimal look.', 'Bai Stone champagne-gold flared vase resting on a cluster of rounded orbs'),
  (8, '10-calder-worth-black', '10-calder-worth-black', 'Calder Worth 10" Black Sculptural Vase', 'Bold and minimal, the Calder Worth vase has a low, sweeping asymmetric shape in matte black. Its wave-like profile makes it as much a sculpture as a vessel. At 10 inches it adds graphic contrast to light shelves, coffee tables and desks, and looks striking with a single dried branch.', 'Calder Worth 10-inch matte black asymmetric sculptural vase'),
  (9, '17-metal-hortonland-gray', '17-metal-hortonland-gray', 'Hortonland 17" Metal Vase, Gray', 'The Hortonland vase reflects light beautifully across its rippled surface. Its flat, rounded moon shape is finished in a rich gunmetal gray metal, giving it an industrial yet elegant feel. At 17 inches it is ideal for console tables, mantels and open shelving, and pairs well with silver and black accents.', 'Hortonland 17-inch gunmetal gray metal moon-shaped vase with rippled texture'),
  (10, 'ribbed-metalic-floor-vase', 'terini-27-silver-metal-floor-vase', 'Terini 27" Silver Metal Floor Vase', 'Add height and polish with the Terini floor vase. Its tall, slender body is shaped with horizontal ribbing and finished in silver metal, so it catches light from every side. At 27 inches it suits entryways, living room corners and beside a TV console, on its own or with tall stems.', 'Terini 27-inch tall ribbed silver metal floor vase'),
  (11, '15-beled-large-handcrafted-vase', '15-beled-large-handcrafted-vase', 'Beled 15" Handcrafted Floral Relief Vase', 'Artisan detail makes the Beled vase special. Handcrafted in soft ivory, its oval body is decorated with raised floral relief that adds texture and gentle shadow. At 15 inches it brings a romantic, gallery-like feel to shelves, side tables and bedroom dressers.', 'Beled 15-inch handcrafted ivory vase with raised floral relief'),
  (12, '18-organic-edge', '18-organic-edge', 'Organic Edge 18" Gold Metal Vase', 'Raw and refined at once, the Organic Edge vase has a hammered gold finish and an irregular, torn-edge rim that looks shaped by nature. At 18 inches it makes a strong statement on a console or sideboard, and works well with dried palms, branches or on its own as sculpture.', 'Organic Edge 18-inch hammered gold vase with irregular torn rim'),
  (13, '35-beckettwell-gold-glass-vase', '35-beckettwell-gold-glass-vase', 'Beckettwell 35" Tall Glass Floor Vase', 'Slender and elegant, the Beckettwell stands 35 inches tall with an ombré glass body crowned by an ornate gold topper. It adds height and a touch of glamour to entryways, living room corners and beside a staircase. Style it alone or as part of a group of varying heights.', 'Beckettwell 35-inch tall ombre glass bottle vase with ornate gold topper'),
  (14, 'cream-ginger-jar', 'cream-ginger-jar', 'Cream Floral Ginger Jar with Lid', 'Delicate and timeless, this cream ginger jar is decorated with red blossoms and leafy branches, finished with a gold-trimmed lid. Its traditional rounded shape adds charm to mantels, sideboards and bookshelves. Display one as a focal point or pair two for symmetry.', 'Cream ginger jar with red blossom pattern and gold-trimmed lid'),
  (15, 'white-ginger-jar', 'white-ginger-jar', 'White Swirl Ginger Jar with Gold Lid', 'Clean and classic, this white ginger jar features soft swirl fluting and a lid accented with a gold band. It brightens a mantel, entry table or bookshelf, and is easy to style in pairs. A versatile choice for traditional, modern and coastal homes.', 'White swirl-fluted ginger jar with gold-banded lid'),
  (16, 'black-ginger-jars', 'black-ginger-jars', 'Black Ginger Jar with Gold Finial', 'Bold and timeless, this glossy black ginger jar is finished with a lid and gold finial. The deep black glaze adds drama and contrast to light walls, marble tops and open shelving. Display it alone or in a pair for a polished, designer look.', 'Glossy black ginger jar with lid and gold finial'),
  (17, 'gold-metal-rib-floor-vase', 'gold-metal-rib-floor-vase', 'Gold Ribbed Floor Vase, 35"–58"', 'Make a tall statement with this textured gold floor vase. Its slender, tapered body is finished in warm gold metal with fine ribbed texture. Available in 35, 48 and 58 inch heights, it can stand alone in a corner or be grouped in different sizes for a dramatic display in entryways, living rooms and hotel lobbies.', 'Tall slender gold ribbed metal floor vase'),
  (18, 'gold-s-vase', 'gold-s-vase', 'Gold S-Curve Ribbed Vase', 'Playful and luxe, the Gold S vase curves in a sculptural loop with a polished, ribbed gold finish. It brings modern glam energy to shelves, coffee tables and bar carts, and looks great with a single stem or on its own as a decorative object.', 'Polished gold ribbed vase in a sculptural S-curve shape'),
  (19, 'cornett-vase', 'cornett-vase', 'Cornett White Ceramic Vase', 'The Cornett vase has an artisan feel, with a sculptural flared shoulder, narrow neck and speckled white glaze above a textured, raw base. It suits modern rustic, Japandi and minimalist spaces, and looks lovely with a single dried stem on a shelf or side table.', 'Cornett white speckled ceramic vase with flared shoulder and textured base'),
  (20, 'peaked-glass-vase-16-x-21-5', 'peaked-glass-vase-16-x-21-5', 'Peaked Brown Glass Vase', 'The Peaked vase is defined by its petal-like pointed rim and warm brown glass that glows when light passes through. It is a graceful accent on a windowsill, dining table or shelf, with or without fresh flowers.', 'Peaked brown glass vase with pointed petal-shaped rim'),
  (21, 'metal-10-pavia', 'metal-10-pavia', 'Pavia 10" Gold Metal Vase', 'The Pavia vase has a wide, rounded oval body in champagne-gold metal with a wavy, ribbed opening along the top. Its low profile makes it ideal for coffee tables, consoles and dining tables, either as sculpture or filled with short-stemmed flowers.', 'Pavia 10-inch champagne gold metal vase with wide oval body and ribbed wavy opening'),
  (22, 'metal-pavia-large-gold-vase', 'metal-pavia-large-gold-vase', 'Pavia Large Gold Metal Vase', 'The larger Pavia vase brings the same sculptural oval form in champagne-gold metal, with a ribbed, wave-like opening that adds movement. It makes a striking centrepiece on dining tables, sideboards and entry consoles.', 'Pavia large champagne gold metal vase with ribbed wave-like opening'),
  (23, 'padmini-large-lidded-jar', 'padmini-large-lidded-jar', 'Padmini 27" Large Lidded Jar', 'Tall and graceful, the Padmini lidded jar stands 27 inches with a slender, curving body in rich bronze-brown, a gray base band and a pointed lid. It adds height and warmth to entryways, living room corners and beside furniture, alone or in a pair.', 'Padmini 27-inch tall bronze-brown lidded jar with gray base'),
  (24, 'tiziano-large-ceramic-bronze-flo', 'tiziano-large-ceramic-bronze-flo', 'Tiziano 34" Bronze Ceramic Floor Vase', 'The Tiziano floor vase stands 34 inches with a tall cylindrical form in a rich bronze ceramic glaze. Its warm, metallic sheen brings depth to entryways and living rooms, and it holds tall branches or pampas grass beautifully.', 'Tiziano 34-inch tall bronze glazed ceramic floor vase'),
  (25, '21-procida-large-vase-white', '21-procida-large-vase-white', 'Procida 21" Large White & Gold Vase', 'The Procida large vase pairs a clean white cylindrical body with a bold gold accent running down one side. At 21 inches it is a tall, modern accent for consoles, sideboards and floors, and looks great with white florals or greenery.', 'Procida 21-inch tall white cylindrical vase with gold accent stripe'),
  (26, 'dubuque-large-cer-vase', 'dubuque-large-cer-vase', 'Dubuque 30" Large White Ceramic Vase', 'The Dubuque vase twists gracefully from base to rim in matte white ceramic, creating soft shadows as light moves around it. At 30 inches it is tall enough to stand on the floor and works beautifully in modern, minimal and coastal spaces.', 'Dubuque 30-inch tall white ceramic vase with twisted sculptural form'),
  (27, 'procida-medium-vase-white', 'procida-medium-vase-white', 'Procida 16" Medium White & Gold Vase', 'The medium Procida vase has a clean white cylindrical body with a bold gold accent. At 16 inches it fits on shelves, side tables and consoles, and pairs well with the 21" Procida for a layered display.', 'Procida 16-inch white cylindrical vase with gold accent stripe'),
  (28, 'utica-large-metal-vase-gold', 'utica-large-metal-vase-gold', 'Utica 23" Large Gold Metal Vase', 'The Utica vase has a flat, rounded moon shape with a crinkled, textured gold finish that shimmers in the light. At 23 inches it is a striking statement for consoles, mantels and entry tables, adding warmth and glamour to modern and traditional rooms.', 'Utica 23-inch large gold metal moon-shaped vase with crinkled texture'),
  (29, 'pierced-gold-temple-jar-24', 'pierced-gold-temple-jar-24', 'Pierced Gold Temple Jar, 24"', 'Intricate and eye-catching, this gold temple jar is decorated with a pierced, cut-out pattern that lets light and shadow play across its surface. Standing 24 inches with a matching lid, it is a luxurious focal point for sideboards, entry tables and mantels.', '24-inch gold temple jar with pierced cut-out pattern and lid'),
  (30, 'pierced-ceramic-temple-jar-gold', 'pierced-ceramic-temple-jar-gold', 'Pierced Gold Ceramic Temple Jar', 'This ceramic temple jar features a pierced lattice pattern in metallic gold over a darker interior, finished with a lidded top. It adds a luxurious, global touch to bookshelves, side tables and sideboards, and pairs well with the 24" pierced temple jar.', 'Gold ceramic temple jar with pierced lattice pattern and lid'),
  (31, 'organic-edge-metal-vase-champagne', 'organic-edge-metal-vase-champagne', 'Organic Edge 13" Champagne Metal Vase', 'The Organic Edge vase in champagne gold has a hammered metal finish and a freeform, torn-edge rim that feels shaped by nature. At 13 inches it suits shelves, coffee tables and consoles, and pairs well with the 18" gold version.', 'Organic Edge 13-inch champagne gold hammered metal vase with freeform rim'),
  (32, 'arouca-small-portugal-vase', 'arouca-small-portugal-vase', 'Arouca 14" Small Blue-Gray Ceramic Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the Arouca vase has a rounded gourd shape with fine vertical ribbing under a soft blue-gray glaze. At 14 inches it brings a calm, coastal feel to shelves, side tables and bathrooms.', 'Arouca 14-inch blue-gray ribbed ceramic gourd vase'),
  (33, 'tomar-vase-8-5-x-8-5', 'tomar-vase-8-5-x-8-5', 'Tomar 8.5" Small Ribbed Vase', 'Small but full of character, the Tomar vase has a rounded, ribbed body in a cream glaze with fine gray lines. At 8.5 inches it is perfect for bedside tables, bathroom counters and bookshelves, with or without a small posy.', 'Tomar 8.5-inch cream ribbed round vase with gray lines'),
  (34, 'fringe-vase-9-25-x-10-25', 'fringe-vase-9-25-x-10-25', 'Fringe 10" Textured Brown Vase', 'Rich in texture, the Fringe vase is covered in layered, fringe-like detail in earthy brown tones. Its rounded 9.25" x 10.25" shape adds a boho, handcrafted feel to coffee tables, shelves and consoles.', 'Fringe round brown vase with layered fringe-like texture'),
  (35, 'orange-bud-vase', 'orange-bud-vase', 'Orange Slice Bud Vase', 'Bring a burst of colour with this playful orange slice bud vase. Shaped like a fresh citrus wedge, it holds a single stem or small sprig, and makes a cheerful accent for kitchen windowsills, desks and breakfast tables. A fun gift idea, too.', 'Orange slice shaped ceramic bud vase'),
  (36, '16-procida-large-vase-brown-2', '16-procida-large-vase-brown-2', 'Procida 16" Ribbed Taupe Vase', 'The Procida vase has a soft, rounded ovoid shape with fine vertical ribbing in a warm taupe-brown glaze. At 16 inches it brings natural warmth to shelves and side tables, and suits earthy, Japandi and modern rustic interiors.', 'Procida 16-inch taupe ribbed ovoid vase'),
  (37, '21-seward-small-glass-vase', '21-seward-small-glass-vase', 'Seward 21" Textured Smoke Glass Vase', 'Tall and refined, the Seward vase is made of textured smoky glass that softly diffuses light. At 21 inches it holds long-stemmed flowers and branches well, and adds a modern, airy touch to consoles and dining tables.', 'Seward 21-inch tall textured smoky glass vase'),
  (38, '16-procida-large-vase-brown', 'stitched-12-terracotta-vase', 'Stitched 12" Terracotta Vase', 'Earthy and full of character, this terracotta vase is finished in warm tan with decorative stitch detailing down one side, like hand-sewn leather. At 12 inches it suits rustic, boho and modern organic spaces on shelves and side tables.', '12-inch tan terracotta vase with decorative stitch detailing'),
  (39, '13-varena-small-red-vase', '13-varena-small-red-vase', 'Varena 13" Small Red Vase', 'Bold and sculptural, the Varena vase is shaped like a petal-wrapped flower bud in glossy red. At 13 inches it brings vivid colour to shelves, tables and neutral rooms, and pairs with the 16" Varena for a striking duo.', 'Varena 13-inch glossy red vase shaped like a petal-wrapped bud'),
  (40, '16-varena-large-red-vase-ev22000-01-13-varena', 'varena-16-large-red-vase', 'Varena 16" Large Red Vase', 'The larger Varena vase brings its glossy red, petal-wrapped bud shape to 16 inches. It makes a bold statement on consoles and sideboards, and adds a confident pop of colour to neutral spaces.', 'Varena 16-inch large glossy red bud-shaped vase'),
  (41, '10-zina-textured-metal-vase-gold', '10-zina-textured-metal-vase-gold', 'Zina 10" Gold Faceted Metal Vase', 'The Zina vase has a faceted, geometric shape in textured gold metal that reflects light from every angle. At 10 inches it is a compact statement for shelves, desks and coffee tables in modern and glam interiors.', 'Zina 10-inch faceted geometric gold metal vase'),
  (42, 'ecomix-15-abstract-vase-ivor', 'ecomix-15-abstract-vase-ivor', 'Abstract 15" Ivory Vase', 'The Abstract vase has a stacked, sculptural silhouette in soft ivory with gray ring accents near the neck. At 15 inches it brings a modern, artful touch to consoles, shelves and side tables.', 'Abstract 15-inch ivory stacked sculptural vase with gray rings'),
  (43, '8-bust-vase-sand-finish-ivory', '8-bust-vase-sand-finish-ivory', '8" Sand Finish Ivory Vase', 'This petite ivory vase has a soft, sand-textured finish that feels natural and calm. At 8 inches it suits bedside tables, bathrooms and bookshelves, with or without a few dried stems.', '8-inch ivory vase with sand-textured finish'),
  (44, 'watermelon-bud-vase', 'watermelon-bud-vase', 'Watermelon Slice Bud Vase', 'Sweet and playful, this bud vase is shaped like a juicy watermelon slice. It holds a single stem or sprig of herbs, and brightens kitchen counters, desks and breakfast tables. A fun gift for anyone who loves colourful decor.', 'Watermelon slice shaped ceramic bud vase'),
  (45, 'banna-bud-vase', 'banana-bud-vase', 'Banana Bud Vase', 'This cheerful bud vase is shaped like a ripe yellow banana, with openings for small stems. It adds a playful, tropical touch to kitchens, desks and shelves, and makes a fun gift.', 'Yellow banana shaped ceramic bud vase'),
  (46, 'atwood-vase-12-x-10-25', 'atwood-vase-12-x-10-25', 'Atwood 12" Brushstroke Vase', 'The Atwood vase has a rounded cream body painted with bold, dark brushstroke stripes for an artisan, hand-finished look. At 12 x 10.25 inches it suits shelves, consoles and coffee tables in modern and earthy spaces.', 'Atwood 12-inch round cream vase with dark brushstroke stripes'),
  (47, 'belvedere-vase-15-5-x-16-5', 'belvedere-vase-15-5-x-16-5', 'Belvedere 16.5" Glass Pedestal Vase', 'The Belvedere is a clear glass pedestal vase with a wide, shallow bowl on a slender stem. At 15.5 x 16.5 inches it makes an elegant centrepiece for weddings, events and dining tables, filled with floating flowers, candles or fruit.', 'Belvedere clear glass pedestal vase with wide bowl on a slender stem'),
  (48, 'belvedere-vase-11-5-x-11', 'belvedere-vase-11-5-x-11', 'Belvedere 11" Glass Pedestal Vase', 'The smaller Belvedere glass pedestal vase has a wide, shallow bowl on a slender stem. At 11.5 x 11 inches it is ideal for table centrepieces, events and entertaining, filled with flowers, floating candles or decorative fillers.', 'Small Belvedere clear glass pedestal vase with wide bowl'),
  (49, 'serpentine-pitcher-12-25-x-10-x8-25', 'serpentine-pitcher-12-25-x-10-x8-25', 'Serpentine 12" Ceramic Pitcher Vase', 'The Serpentine pitcher has a low, rounded body and a gracefully curving handle in warm tan. Use it as a decorative vase for loose flowers, or style it empty on a shelf, kitchen counter or dining table for a vintage, handcrafted look.', 'Serpentine tan ceramic pitcher vase with curving handle'),
  (50, 'terracotta-vase-13-w-14-h', 'terracotta-vase-13-w-14-h', 'White Terracotta Vase, 14"', 'This terracotta vase has a wide, rounded body and short neck in a clean matte white finish. At 13" wide and 14" tall it works as a standalone accent on floors, consoles and shelves, or with lush greenery.', '14-inch white matte terracotta vase with wide rounded body'),
  (51, 'alum-gold-floor-vase-s-2-33-30-h', 'alum-gold-floor-vase-s-2-33-30-h', 'Gold Aluminum Floor Vases, Set of 2', 'This set of two gold aluminum floor vases (33" and 30" tall) has slender, gently flared bodies with a textured finish. Grouped together they add height and warmth to entryways, living rooms, hotel lobbies and event spaces.', 'Set of two tall textured gold aluminum floor vases, 33 and 30 inches'),
  (52, 'teracotta-vase-14-w-10-h', 'weathered-terracotta-vase-14-wide', 'Weathered Terracotta Vase, 14" Wide', 'This low, wide terracotta vase has a weathered cream finish with a soft blue-gray patterned wash, giving it an aged, collected look. At 14" wide and 10" tall it suits coffee tables, consoles and rustic or Mediterranean interiors.', 'Wide terracotta vase with weathered cream and blue-gray patterned finish'),
  (53, 'mo-vase-18-w-24-h', 'mo-vase-18-w-24-h', 'Mo 24" Rustic Terracotta Vase', 'The Mo vase has a rustic amphora shape with small lug handles and an aged finish that fades from deep brown to cream. At 24 inches tall and 18 inches wide, it makes a strong earthy statement on floors, in entryways and on patios.', 'Mo 24-inch rustic amphora vase with lug handles and brown-to-cream finish'),
  (54, 'glass-vase-11-w-18-h', 'glass-vase-11-w-18-h', 'Tulip 18" Clear Glass Vase', 'The Tulip vase is made of clear glass with a softly ruffled, petal-like rim. At 18 inches tall it is perfect for fresh flower arrangements, and adds a light, airy feel to dining tables, entry consoles and event tables.', 'Tulip 18-inch clear glass vase with ruffled petal-like rim'),
  (55, '16-ethereal-large-3d-printed-vase', '16-ethereal-large-3d-printed-vase', 'Ethereal 16" Large 3D Printed Vase', 'The Ethereal vase is 3D printed with flowing spiral ribs that twist from base to rim in soft white. At 16 inches it creates beautiful light and shadow on consoles, shelves and side tables in modern and minimalist homes.', 'Ethereal 16-inch white 3D printed vase with spiral ribs'),
  (56, '15-racine-small-gold-vase', '15-racine-small-gold-vase', 'Racine 15" Small Gold Swirl Vase', 'The Racine vase has a rounded, squat body wrapped in sculpted swirl ribs with a champagne-gold finish. At 15 inches it adds warmth and movement to consoles and sideboards, and pairs with the 18" Racine.', 'Racine 15-inch champagne gold vase with sculpted swirl ribs'),
  (57, '20-crato-large-portugal-vase', '20-crato-large-portugal-vase', 'Crato 20" Large Black Glazed Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the Crato vase has a curved silhouette finished in a glossy black reactive glaze with speckled gray tones near the neck. At 20 inches it adds depth and drama to consoles, sideboards and floors.', 'Crato 20-inch black and gray reactive glaze ceramic vase'),
  (58, 'iron-25-h-oval-stain-vase-black', 'iron-25-h-oval-stain-vase-black', '25" Oval Black Drip-Glaze Vase', 'This 25-inch oval vase has a glossy black finish with brown and white drip detail that gives every piece a unique look. It adds drama and height to consoles, sideboards and floors. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '25-inch oval black vase with brown and white drip glaze'),
  (59, '20-sagres-large-portugal-vase', '20-sagres-large-portugal-vase', 'Sagres 20" Large Brown Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the Sagres vase has a smooth teardrop shape with a narrow neck in warm matte brown. At 20 inches it brings simple, earthy elegance to consoles and floors. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Sagres 20-inch matte brown teardrop vase'),
  (60, '18x9-bird-and-flower-temple-jar-green-b', '18x9-bird-and-flower-temple-jar-green-b', 'Bird & Flower 18" Green Temple Jar', 'A classic chinoiserie piece, this lidded temple jar is decorated with white birds and blossoms on rich green. At 18 x 9 inches it is a timeless focal point for sideboards, mantels and entry tables. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '18-inch green temple jar with white bird and flower chinoiserie pattern and lid'),
  (61, '13-sagres-small-portugal-vase', '13-sagres-small-portugal-vase', 'Sagres 13" Small Brown Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the smaller Sagres vase has a wide, flattened round body and narrow neck in matte brown. At 13 inches it suits shelves and side tables. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Sagres 13-inch small round matte brown vase'),
  (62, '10x6-bird-and-flower-temple-jar-green-b', '10x6-bird-and-flower-temple-jar-green-b', 'Bird & Flower 10" Small Green Temple Jar', 'This petite lidded temple jar features white birds and blossoms on rich green in classic chinoiserie style. At 10 x 6 inches it is ideal for shelves and side tables, and pairs with the 18" version. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Small 10-inch green temple jar with white bird and flower chinoiserie pattern'),
  (63, '22x17-terracotta-jug-vase-w-handle', '22x17-terracotta-jug-vase-w-handle', 'Terracotta 22" Jug Vase with Handle', 'This terracotta jug vase has a classic Mediterranean shape with a single handle and a weathered, stone-like finish. At 22 x 17 inches it is a rustic statement for floors, patios and entryways. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '22-inch weathered terracotta jug vase with handle'),
  (64, '8-escoural-small-portugal-vase', '8-escoural-small-portugal-vase', 'Escoural 8" Small Cream Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the Escoural small vase has a wide, low body with a cream reactive drip glaze. At 8 inches it is a charming accent for coffee tables and shelves. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Escoural 8-inch low wide cream drip-glaze vase'),
  (65, '17-escoural-large-portugal-vase', '17-escoural-large-portugal-vase', 'Escoural 17" Large Cream Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the Escoural large vase has a graceful teardrop shape with a cream reactive glaze that drips softly from the neck. At 17 inches it suits consoles and sideboards. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Escoural 17-inch teardrop vase with cream reactive drip glaze'),
  (66, '14x11-modern-shape-terracotta-vase', '14x11-modern-shape-terracotta-vase', 'Modern 14" Earthy Terracotta Vase', 'This terracotta vase has a wide, rounded shape with a rough, earthy finish in mottled brown. At 14 x 11 inches it suits rustic, wabi-sabi and organic modern interiors. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '14-inch rounded brown terracotta vase with earthy textured finish'),
  (67, '11-serenity-small-3d-pritned-vase', 'serenity-11-small-3d-printed-vase', 'Serenity 11" Small 3D Printed Vase', 'The Serenity vase is 3D printed in soft white with spiral ribs that wrap a curvy hourglass shape. At 11 inches it brings a calm, modern touch to shelves and side tables. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Serenity 11-inch white 3D printed spiral-ribbed hourglass vase'),
  (68, '17-almada-small-oversized-portuga', '17-almada-small-oversized-portuga', 'Almada 17" White & Brown Drip Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the Almada vase has a white body with a dramatic brown drip glaze and slanted rim. At 17 inches it adds artisan character to consoles and shelves. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Almada 17-inch white vase with brown drip glaze and slanted rim'),
  (69, '15x11-ornamental-glass-vase-champa', '15x11-ornamental-glass-vase-champa', 'Ornamental 15" Champagne Vase', 'This ornamental vase has a classic urn shape in a cream-to-champagne ombré with a sculpted metallic leaf and branch accent. At 15 x 11 inches it is a refined accent for consoles and mantels. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '15-inch cream and champagne ombre urn vase with sculpted leaf and branch accent'),
  (70, '24x14-terracotta-floor-vase-dark-br', '24x14-terracotta-floor-vase-dark-br', 'Terracotta 24" Brown & White Floor Vase', 'This terracotta floor vase has a deep dark brown glaze that drips down into a white base, creating a bold two-tone look. At 24 x 14 inches it adds height to entryways and living room corners. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '24-inch terracotta floor vase in dark brown glaze fading to white'),
  (71, '18-beled-large-handcrafted-vase', '18-beled-large-handcrafted-vase', 'Beled 18" Large Handcrafted Floral Vase', 'The larger Beled vase is handcrafted in white with raised floral relief across its tall oval body. At 18 inches it brings romantic, gallery-like texture to consoles and sideboards. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Beled 18-inch handcrafted white vase with raised floral relief'),
  (72, 'glass-14-antique-ring-vase-gold', 'glass-14-antique-ring-vase-gold', 'Antique Ring 14" Gold Glass Vase', 'The Antique Ring vase is made of glass banded with rings of gold, cream and smoky tones for a vintage, layered look. At 14 inches it suits shelves, consoles and bar areas. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Antique Ring 14-inch glass vase with gold, cream and smoky bands'),
  (73, 'terracotta-16-organic-jug-with-2-clay-color', 'terracotta-16-organic-jug-with-2-clay-color', 'Organic 16" Terracotta Jug, Clay', 'This organic terracotta jug has a rounded body and two side handles in a soft natural clay colour. At 16 inches it brings a warm Mediterranean feel to consoles, kitchens and patios. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '16-inch clay-coloured terracotta jug with two handles'),
  (74, 'terracotta-16-organic-jug-with-2', 'terracotta-16-organic-jug-with-2', 'Organic 16" Terracotta Jug, Black', 'This organic terracotta jug has a rounded body and two side handles in matte black, a modern take on a classic Mediterranean shape. At 16 inches it suits consoles, shelves and entryways. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '16-inch matte black terracotta jug with two handles'),
  (75, '16x11-terracotta-vase-green-2', '16x11-terracotta-vase-green-2', 'Terracotta 16" Weathered Green Vase', 'This terracotta vase has a weathered sage-green finish with rich surface texture that looks collected over time. At 16 x 11 inches it suits rustic, Mediterranean and organic modern spaces. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '16-inch weathered sage green terracotta vase'),
  (76, '11-elphantine-3d-printed-vase-ivory', '11-elphantine-3d-printed-vase-ivory', 'Elphantine 11" 3D Printed Vase, Ivory', 'The Elphantine vase is 3D printed in ivory with a rounded, gently flattened shape and a soft textured surface. At 11 inches it brings subtle detail to shelves and side tables. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Elphantine 11-inch ivory 3D printed textured vase'),
  (77, '13-ethereal-small-3d-printed-vase', '13-ethereal-small-3d-printed-vase', 'Ethereal 13" Small 3D Printed Vase', 'The smaller Ethereal vase is 3D printed with flowing spiral ribs in soft white. At 13 inches it pairs with the 16" Ethereal for a layered display on shelves and consoles. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Ethereal 13-inch white 3D printed vase with flowing spiral ribs'),
  (78, '21x13-black-drift-terracotta-vase-bl', '21x13-black-drift-terracotta-vase-bl', 'Black Drift 21" Terracotta Vase', 'The Black Drift vase has a glossy black glaze that drifts down into a raw, earthy brown base for a striking two-tone effect. At 21 x 13 inches it suits consoles and floors. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Black Drift 21-inch terracotta vase with black glaze over earthy brown base'),
  (79, '18-racine-large-gold-vase', '18-racine-large-gold-vase', 'Racine 18" Large Gold Swirl Vase', 'The larger Racine vase has a rounded body wrapped in sculpted swirl ribs with a champagne-gold finish. At 18 inches it makes a warm statement on sideboards and consoles. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Racine 18-inch champagne gold vase with sculpted swirl ribs'),
  (80, '15-seymour-3d-printed-vase-apple', '15-seymour-3d-printed-vase-apple', 'Seymour 15" 3D Printed Vase, Amber', 'The Seymour vase is 3D printed in a warm amber tone with fine ribs wrapping a curvy hourglass shape. At 15 inches it adds a pop of colour to shelves and consoles. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Seymour 15-inch amber 3D printed ribbed hourglass vase'),
  (81, '14-monforte-large-portugal-vase', '14-monforte-large-portugal-vase', 'Monforte 14" Black & White Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the Monforte vase has a white body with bold black brushstroke drips for a graphic, artisan look. At 14 inches it suits shelves and consoles. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Monforte 14-inch white vase with bold black brushstrokes'),
  (82, '13x10-terracotta-vase-with-handles', '13x10-terracotta-vase-with-handles', 'Terracotta 13" Green Vase with Handles', 'This terracotta vase has a classic amphora shape with two handles and a weathered sage-green finish. At 13 x 10 inches it suits shelves, kitchens and patios. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '13-inch weathered sage green terracotta vase with two handles'),
  (83, '14-crato-small-portugal-vase', '14-crato-small-portugal-vase', 'Crato 14" Small Black Glazed Vase', 'Part of our Portugal collection, the smaller Crato vase has a slim, curved silhouette in glossy black with speckled gray at the neck. At 14 inches it pairs with the 20" Crato. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Crato 14-inch black and gray reactive glaze vase'),
  (84, '14-fontana-short-italian-art-glass-va', '14-fontana-short-italian-art-glass-va', 'Fontana 14" Italian Art Glass Vase', 'The Fontana is an Italian art glass vase with a wide, ruffled bowl in amber and ivory tones that glow in the light. At 14 inches it makes an elegant centrepiece. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Fontana 14-inch Italian art glass vase with ruffled amber and ivory bowl'),
  (85, 'alondra-small-ceramic-lidded-flo', 'alondra-small-ceramic-lidded-flo', 'Alondra Small Ceramic Lidded Jar', 'The Alondra lidded jar pairs glossy black with a cream band and a pointed finial for a refined, two-tone look. It adds height and elegance to consoles and shelves. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Alondra small black and cream ceramic lidded jar with pointed finial'),
  (86, 'terracotta-18-organic-jug-with-ha', 'terracotta-18-organic-jug-with-ha', 'Organic 18" Black Terracotta Jug', 'This organic terracotta jug has a rounded body, spout and single handle in matte black. At 18 inches it is a modern, sculptural accent for consoles and entryways. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '18-inch matte black terracotta jug with handle'),
  (87, '19x14-ornamental-glass-vase-champa', '19x14-ornamental-glass-vase-champa', 'Ornamental 19" Champagne Vase', 'This larger ornamental vase has a classic urn shape in cream-to-champagne ombré with a sculpted metallic leaf and branch accent. At 19 x 14 inches it is a refined statement for consoles. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', '19-inch cream and champagne ombre urn vase with sculpted leaf and branch accent'),
  (88, '16-elphantine-3d-printed-vase-ivory', '16-elphantine-3d-printed-vase-ivory', 'Elphantine 16" 3D Printed Vase, Ivory', 'The larger Elphantine vase is 3D printed in ivory with a rounded, gently flattened body and soft textured surface. At 16 inches it suits consoles and sideboards. Coming soon. Message us on WhatsApp to reserve.', 'Elphantine 16-inch ivory 3D printed textured vase');
